# XML - ASCII only

All XML under `gamedata/` must use **7-bit ASCII** in element text and attributes.

## Forbidden in player-visible and config XML

- Em dash, en dash, curly quotes, ellipsis character, non-breaking space
- Any Unicode punctuation or symbols outside basic ASCII

## Use ASCII substitutes

| Instead of | Use |
|------------|-----|
| em dash | ` - ` (space-hyphen-space) |
| en dash | `-` |
| curly quotes | straight `"` or `'` |
| ellipsis character | `...` |

## Encoding

String tables use `<?xml version="1.0" encoding="windows-1251"?>`. Stick to ASCII subset so encoding never surprises the game parser.

Before finishing, scan new or edited XML for non-ASCII code points.
